<title>USA: Star Banc issues $100 mln in 10-year notes.</title>
<headline>Star Banc issues $100 mln in 10-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Star</p>
<p>Banc Corp was priced Tuesday, according to lead manager UBS</p>
<p>Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER STAR BANC CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 12/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.269  FIRST PAY DATE 06/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.726 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 67 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
